{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124042","id":4695623679,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF-GH_w","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124042","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124042.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124042.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124042","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124042/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124042/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124042/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3187b6040be79f614e6c14892c43c1cb64e0d03f","number":124042,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix mouse error on startup on platforms without mouse support","user":{"login":"oxeron","id":587942,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4Nzk0Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/587942?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron","html_url":"https://github.com/oxeron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/oxeron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes #124041\r\n\r\nOn display servers without `FEATURE_MOUSE` (e.g. iOS), the root `Window` prints `Mouse is not supported by this display server.` on every startup. The simulated mouse-enter check in `Window::_notification()` calls `DisplayServer::mouse_get_position()` unconditionally.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nThis checks `FEATURE_MOUSE` before querying the mouse position, the same way `Viewport::get_mouse_position()` already does. Without a mouse there is nothing to simulate, so skipping the mouse-enter event is the intended behavior.\r\n\r\nNot tested with a rebuilt iOS template yet: the error and its source were confirmed on an iPhone 12 Pro with 4.7.2.stable and the MRP in the linked issue.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"